{"id":"wb-6-621","name":"法行寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"法行寺塔","text":"法行寺塔，位于中华人民共和国河南省汝州市内东北隅的塔寺街，原法行寺旧址上。该塔于1963年被列为第一批河南省文物保护单位，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E8%A1%8C%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93684693,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93684693","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0d3fb616034f0be474426c9a.jpg","title":"20260412_Pagoda_of_Faxing_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260412_Pagoda_of_Faxing_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/20260412_Pagoda_of_Faxing_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汝州 法行寺塔","width":320,"height":480}}